# @ui/gpu/compute — the GPU-native compilation kernel-tower dispatch
# sub-species under @ui/gpu.
#
# Sub-species under @ui/gpu at the compilation-kernel altitude;
# realizes the six-week-old hedge-5 Metal-kernel forward-promise
# (from `shards/ui/gpu.mirror`:73-76) by exposing the seven kernel-
# tower operations K1..K7 (per math §8.2 + §8.3 + Corollary 8.3.1)
# as substrate-declared actions dispatched to fate's MetalRuntime
# via the @io/gpu-via-fate boundary (per math §9.3-§9.4).
#
# === Landing metadata ===
#
# Landed 2026-08-01 by Mara as Phase B of the R5+R7 respawn task
# per Reed dispatch (Recognition #R-doublespeak-at-compiler-altitude
# CANDIDATE landing tick; Q3 = YES LAND Alex-ratified default per
